      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JIMMYS RAINBOW (1) settled close to the pace then found the front before finishing second last start over 2130m at this track, adding to his sound recent efforts. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Won't find this any harder and he can add to the impressive recent record. ULTIMATE SHOT (4) finished fourth at this track two runs ago before a comparable effort at his latest appearance over 1609m at Bunbury, beaten 13 metres. This is a nice drop in grade so he is in the right race to return to form. UMBERTO (11) had a wide draw when midfield on debut. Open to improvement. WHATHITSTHEEYE (5) was beaten 4 metres on debut last start over 1684m at Pinjarra. Could progress.",
